        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "Infinite Union is a web development agency based in Kharkiv, Ukraine, working with small and mid-sized businesses across the EU. We build websites, Telegram bots and SaaS platforms, and we run Google, Meta and TikTok ads. You talk directly to the people who build your project, in English, and when we finish you own the source code and every account. Fixed prices start at $600 for a website and $300 for a bot. See the full breakdown on our pricing page."
        }
      ]
    },
